Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "status": "watching"
}

### 45. 無効なステータスでお気に入り登録
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/favorites/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "status": "invalid_status"
}

### 46. 存在しないエピソードの視聴状態更新
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/episodes/99999/watch
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "viewed": true
}

### 47. 無効な評価値でアニメ評価
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/animes/1/rating
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "rating": 6.0,
  "comment": "範囲外の評価値"
}

### ===== 管理者API（データ同期） =====

### 48. 今期アニメをデータベースに同期
